SOURCE_FILE
  VERBATIM
    CLASS_KW "class"
    WHITESPACE " "
    IDENT "C"
    SEMICOLON ";"
    WHITESPACE "\n  "
    INT_KW "int"
    WHITESPACE " "
    IDENT "x"
    SEMICOLON ";"
  WHITESPACE "\n"
---
error[unclosed-at-end-of-file] 1:1 "class": the file ends with `class` still open (expected `endclass`)
